WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.720
Thanks to Kiyoshi-dono, our expulsion has been postponed.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.330
Nonetheless, we have been
reprieved for only a single day.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.760
I wish to impress upon you...

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.320
the fact that we have no chance of victory if we do not act swiftly.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:23.570
Kiyoshi-dono, are you all clear on the needed arrangements?

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.330
Yeah. This is the only way, after all.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.030
I sent out a note

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.960
saying to prepare for
the moment in question...

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.530
to Chiyo-chan.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.840
I understand your
wish to keep her out of this,

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.500
but without Chiyo-dono's
help, this plan is not possible.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.280
I'm challenging the vice president again at lunchtime, right?

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:42.960
Yes.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.040
Just as you did for the arm wrestling competition,

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.570
you will lure the vice president into a contest while

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.490
yours truly sneaks
into the Corrections Office.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.470
Yeah, but Andre totally got
his clock cleaned last time.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.950
Are you sure the vice president will take him on again?

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:56.770
Yeah.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:59.500
Yours truly's plan takes that into account, as well.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:04.400
I have thought up a new contest that is sure to entice the competitive vice principal.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.450
They only have a single day to work with.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.370
That is the only chance they have left.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.080
Now then, what actions will they...

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:15.990
take?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.090
Just a moment please, President!

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:51.960
It is true that the blame for their expulsion's postponement lies with me.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:55.350
However, sending Hana as their sole overseer would be dangerous!

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:56.230
Dangerous?

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.760
What do you mean by that?

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.730
Right now, Hana is in a...

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.440
mentally unstable state, you might say.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.100
I'm all right, Vice President.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.890
It's true that I was worked up earlier,

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.870
but with your aid, I've calmed down.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:09.530
Thank you.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.320
But Hana—

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.490
Geez, if you like, you can search me.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.590
I don't have any weapons.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.540
For that matter,

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.660
I'm more worried about <i>you</i>, Vice President.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.270
Kiyoshi thanked you, didn't he?

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.220
For what?

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.170
That... I don't know
why he did such a thing.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.220
Vice President, as unlikely as it may be,

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:33.010
have you gone and
gotten soft on that scum?

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.060
That is not possible!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.280
President, I would never do such a thing!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.510
Butt wrestling,

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.030
is a game where you stand
back-to-back inside a small ring,

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.730
and try to push your opponent out using your buttocks.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.850
Butt-on-butt, flesh-on-flesh,

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.730
competing fiercely at times, and at other times tenderly.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:49.520
It is a sexy and violent competition!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:54.810
<i>That's</i> the new contest you'll use to draw the vice president in with?

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:55.570
Mm-hmm!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:58.370
The vice president must have absolute confidence in her buttocks.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.590
I am certain that she will accept.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.910
It is almost time for lunch.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.160
Andre-dono!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:06.250
Make sure to ably solicit the vice president when she brings our lunch...

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.670
to a butt wrestling match!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.050
Ah! I can't wait for the two of us to go at each other!

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.880
I'd love to get clobbered by the vice president's ample bottom!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.830
Andre, are you sure you've got the right idea about butt wrestling?

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:16.760
Are you sure about this?

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.180
No need to panic.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.950
We will only draw her in at lunchtime.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.770
The true bout is tonight.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:25.320
Hey there!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.770
I brought your lunch!

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:27.520
What?!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:28.190
That's not the...

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:28.650
vice...

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:29.610
president!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.300
Huh? Now what do we do?

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.030
We get started, regardless.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:35.990
Let's go!

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:37.670
It's butt wrestling!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.920
You won't beat me, Gakuto-kun.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:40.360
Hey!

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.080
You got me!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.640
Man, have I had it!

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.790
Andre-dono, you are so strong!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.450
What do you say, Vice P—

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.810
I mean, Hana-dono?

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.460
Would you like to try your hand—

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.250
I mean, your hind end at butt wrest—

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:00.640
Enough with the nonsense, come get your lunch.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.850
Yes!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.850
Listen...

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.360
I've remembered everything that happened in the nurse's office.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.070
Huh?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:17.610
I'll make sure that your eryngii pays, understand?

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.360
My...

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.320
eryngii, you say?

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.000
I am going to settle the score for sure... sometime today.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.140
Kiyoshi-dono, things have taken a turn for the worse.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.890
With Hana-dono, instead of the vice president, the match will not—

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.980
Kiyoshi-dono, are
you listening to me?!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.630
My eryngii?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.550
I doubt she means these butter-sautéed eryngii mushrooms, right?

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.600
Any way you look at it, she means <i>that</i> doesn't she?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.060
What's going to become of my eryngii?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.290
What a worthless girl I am.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.860
How could I betray the president's expectations?

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.400
On top of which, Kiyoshi's cryptic pronouncement

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.070
has undermined the
president's trust in me.

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:57.440
Why would he say such a thing to me?

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:00.110
Vice President? May I have a moment?

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:01.220
President!

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.280
Excuse me for disturbing your training.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.210
I am training so as to not commit any more blunders.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.510
I would never do anything to betray you, President—

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.540
Calm yourself, Vice President.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.650
It seems that you have the wrong idea.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.130
Huh?

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.550
I have never once had any doubts about your loyalty.

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:18.580
President...

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.340
The reason I chose to send Hana to oversee them

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:28.510
is because I thought that they had perhaps begun to predict your behavioral patterns.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:32.260
Having spent so much time with them, it can't be helped if that is so.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.620
However, they will not be able to read Hana so easily.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.940
Which is why, now on their last day,

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:41.180
I've changed their overseer, to keep them from being able to resist us.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.070
President...

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.840
I didn't know you had considered things so thoroughly.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.120
I am so sorry!

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.910
I have been so shallow-minded!

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.000
There is nothing to apologize for.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:53.460
There is another task I'd like you to handle, instead.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:55.590
Another... task?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.500
I have to say,

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.110
your metabolism is
as active as ever, isn't it?

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.080
I am terribly sorry!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.510
I will have your handkerchief
cleaned and returned to you!

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:06.670
It's fine.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.930
I consider it a mark of fine health.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.980
But it has been sullied by my perspiration!

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.760
I do not think of your perspiration as dirty, Vice President.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:18.050
President!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.210
Oh, my.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.570
From now on, I won't just bring a handkerchief, I'd better bring a bath towel.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.910
We are up a creek, gentlemen.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.950
Our plan will not go as scheduled with Hana-dono here.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.620
Yours truly's original plan was to play off the previous arm-wrestling contest

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.910
and draw the vice president into a butt-wrestling match,

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:37.830
and then take the opportunity to sneak into the Corrections Office in the meantime.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.050
We can't solicit Hana-san into a butt-wrestling match.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:41.870
Yeah.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:42.840
Aww...

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.350
Kiyoshi-dono, have you received a reply from Chiyo-dono?

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.430
Yeah, it's here. She says "okay."

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:51.390
Honestly, I didn't want to drag Chiyo-chan into this,

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.350
but there's no other choice, is there?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:57.200
We have only been
afforded a one-day respite.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.230
We move tonight.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:02.900
I want you to respond saying to come to the Corrections Office's rear door after supper.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:05.530
All right.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.760
That being said, right now,

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.350
it is impossible for yours truly to
get inside the Corrections Office.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.950
We have to think of something.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.190
If I'm with her...

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.000
Huh?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.410
If I'm with Hana-san, I can get inside the corrections office.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:22.100
Instead of you, Gakuto, I might be the one that can get into the Corrections Office.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:22.890
Huh?

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.170
What do you mean?

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:28.090
The truth is, Hana-san has a grudge against me.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:31.180
A much deeper grudge than you guys might think.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.280
She made that clear just a moment ago.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.180
What the hell happened between you two?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.640
To preserve Hana-san's honor, I can't tell you.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.680
But if I can manage to exploit that grudge,

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.530
I might be able to get inside the Corrections Office.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:46.200
But then, that would mean...

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.280
that you would be accepting Hana-san's vengeance head-on, correct?

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.530
Hana-san doesn't know how to hold back.

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:53.950
Forget being expelled, you'll be put in the hospital!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.260
You won't get off easy.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.230
That's right.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.220
Kiyoshi-kun, it's not fair to you!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.450
But there's no other way, is there?

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.890
My life has been spared once.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:02.750
So now, I will give it.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.780
Say, can I take that for you?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.510
Ah, Chiyo,

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.390
thanks for always doing this.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:14.770
It's on my way back to class anyhow, so it's fine.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.230
Ma'am!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.060
I brought back the dirty dishes.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:19.770
Thank you. Just leave them there.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:29.410
"Tonight, after supper," huh?

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.900
I shouldn't be doing this,

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.720
but Onee-chan set Kiyoshi-kun and the others up.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.890
I have to help them.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.580
So that's how.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.800
That's how you're communicating with the boys in the prison.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.110
Ah, no, this is...

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.920
You're trying to help them because they were
trapped into getting themselves kicked out, right?

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.840
Who are you?

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.990
Don't look at me like that.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.380
I'm on your side.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.240
I'm Anzu.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.220
I'll help you to keep
them from being expelled.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.670
That scum hasn't made any moves.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:02.450
Why?

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.350
They have been reprieved for just one day.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.650
They had to beguile the chairmain to get that day.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.870
What in the world are they thinking?

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.130
Vice President.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:13.740
Yes?

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:18.840
That scum is sure to make a move
tonight to prevent their expulsion.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:21.000
Be prepared for anything.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:21.990
Yes.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.430
You're sure about this?

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.760
Do it as hard as you can.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.040
Okay, I'm really going to do it.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:30.630
Mm-hmm.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.050
What are you waiting for?

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.310
Hurry it up, would you—

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:38.470
Gah! Your timing is abominable!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:39.580
Sorry!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.360
Well? Did it work?

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:44.020
It is to no avail.
There is no blood at all.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:44.870
You see?

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.590
I told you to do it as hard as you could!

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.460
I wished to conclude it with one shot!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.440
Hey, Gakuto...

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:49.990
Huh?

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:50.700
What is it—

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.820
What are you doing?! Fighting?!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.450
I'm bleeding! I'm bleed—

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.220
Stay away!

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:58.780
It's my fault!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.330
We were arguing, and I just snapped.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.270
Please get him some first aid immediately.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.630
It's just a little cut, isn't it?

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.630
Rub some spit into it, it'll heal.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.570
Bye.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:08.880
Huh?

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.840
Excuse me! Can we at least have a styptic pencil?!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.200
What do we do? What do we do? She's leaving!

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.960
Damn. Damn! Damn!

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.080
This is disastrous!

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:18.770
You'll pay for this,
you nitwit, Kiyoshi-dono!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.430
You're cavorting with
Hana-dono for her help,

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:23.800
and then you go and injure me?!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:24.990
Huh? Hey, Gakuto, what are you—

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:26.740
Kiyoshi-dono, explain yourself!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.040
What is going on between you and Hana-dono?!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.700
You try anything funny, and I'll kill you.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.120
Yeah, <i>I'll</i> patch him up.

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:43.580
Of course you will.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.710
I can't stand that icky stuff.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.500
Um, I'm still out—

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.050
I need to have a word with you, so come with me.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.230
No fair!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.930
You really are trying
to save just Kiyoshi-dono!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.950
Thanks to Gakuto's quick thinking, everything's going as planned.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.730
Now...

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:06.650
Kiyoshi-dono and Hana-dono go into the Corrections Office alone, and then...

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:08.560
Tonight at 8 o'clock.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.400
The prison back door.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.320
They will make their move...

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.330
Tonight, for sure!

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:27.440
At last, the two of us are alone.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:32.260
Kiyoshi, don't tell me you told the others about what happened?

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:34.080
No, I didn't! Honest!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:36.720
What are you planning to do with those?

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.720
What am I going to do, you ask?

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:42.430
I have a score to settle with you
that even killing you won't clear.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:43.980
You saw me peeing,

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.560
you peed all over me,

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:46.570
and then...

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.520
there's the crime of
defiling my precious area!

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:50.820
Say your prayers.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:54.110
I'm going to make
this the most terrifying,

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:56.320
most embarrassing night
of your entire life!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.200
Is this the end for my eryngii?!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.200
Kiyoshi-kun and the others are in a bind,

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.630
so I'll do what I can now.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.180
They're making their move, all right.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.740
For the president's sake,

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:25.390
I will completely put a
stop to their scheme!

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.730
Here. Use this.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:34.410
Huh?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:36.410
